   "working_cs": "CS_Array",
   "notes": "Driven antenna: 2x1 inset-fed patch array on a dispersive laminate with a DC-block chip capacitor (Lumped RLC, grouped with its body), lumped port, finite conductivity, a radome in a relative coordinate system, all mesh operations, three setups (single, multi-frequency, broadband), Interpolating / Fast / Discrete sweeps, two far-field spheres, output variables, Fields Calculator expressions and functions, every report type of a driven antenna, field overlays on objects, faces and cut planes, an optimization and a parametric sweep."
  },
