   "notes": "WR-90 two-cavity iris filter, half model: the full guide is cut with Split, the symmetry plane x = a/2 is a Perfect H Symmetry boundary. Wave ports with two modes, renormalization and de-embedding, an impedance wall, a dielectric tuning post (Unite with a clone, KeepOriginals), Perfect E / Perfect H assignments, a parametric family over the iris width and an eigen-free driven sweep."
  },
